              "value": "Grotesque Gift"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(olfactory)\n\nBolti's attacks spatter his targets with rancid flesh and clotted blood. A creature damaged by one of Bolti's Strikes must succeed at a DC 39 Fortitude save or become sickened 1 (sickened 2 on a critical failure)."
